#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/docs/Docs.js:200
msgid "WP Rocket → Settings → CDN → Clear all cache files. (Or purge from your CDN dashboard directly.) Until you purge, the CDN keeps serving the old response without the new header."
msgstr "WP Rocket → Réglages → CDN → Vider tous les fichiers de cache. (Ou videz-le directement depuis le tableau de bord de votre CDN.) Tant que vous ne le faites pas, le CDN continue de servir l'ancienne réponse sans le nouvel en-tête."

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-docs.2aff582aa4df64b0.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-docs.2aff582aa4df64b0.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/docs/Docs.js:203
msgid "Verify:"
msgstr "Vérification :"

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-docs.2aff582aa4df64b0.chunk.js:2
